FlowDesk reads Flow Cytometry Standard files. FCS 3.1 is an open specification
published by the International Society for Advancement of Cytometry (ISAC);
this is an independent implementation of that published specification. No code,
data or resource from FlowJo, FCS Express or any other cytometry product is
included or was used as a source.

The application shell is Electron (MIT), obtained from npm at build time and
not committed here. No third-party JavaScript library, font or icon set is
embedded in FlowDesk.html.

Flow cytometry data files you open remain yours; FlowDesk reads them locally
and sends nothing anywhere.
